her privacy policy or fair processing notice we may provide on specific occasions when we are collecting or processing personal data about you so that you are fully aware of how and why we are using your data. This privacy policy supplements the other policies and notices and is not intended to override them. ")]),a("h1",{staticClass:"title"},[t._v("Controller")]),a("p",[t._v(" Housefinder Technologies LTD is the controller and responsible for your personal data."),a("br"),t._v(" You can visit our office or call for any questions or request in relation to this privacy policy. "),a("br"),t._v(" It is important that the personal data we hold about you is accurate and current. Please keep us informed if your personal data changes during your relationship with us. ")]),a("h1",{staticClass:"title"},[t._v("Third-party marketing")]),a("p",[t._v(" We will not share your personal data with any company outside Housefinder Technologies LTD for marketing purposes. ")]),a("h1",{staticClass:"title"},[t._v("The data we collect about you")]),a("p",[t._v(" Personal data, or personal information, means any information about an individual from which that person can be identified. It does not include data where the identity has been removed (anonymous data). "),a("br"),t._v(" We may collect, use, store and transfer different kinds of personal data about you which we have grouped together follows: ")]),a("div",{staticClass:"ml-5",class:{"ml-8":t.$vuetify.breakpoint.smAndUp}},[a("p",[a("span",{staticClass:"mr-3"},[t._v("•")]),t._v("Identity Data includes full name, username or similar identifier, marital status, title, date of birth and gender. ")]),a("p",[a("span",{staticClass:"mr-3"},[t._v("•")]),t._v("Contact Data includes address, email address and telephone numbers. ")]),a("p",[a("span",{staticClass:"mr-3"},[t._v("•")]),t._v("Financial Data includes bank account and payment card details. ")]),a("p",[a("span",{staticClass:"mr-3"},[t._v("•")]),t._v("Transaction Data includes details a